# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Next.js build and deployment output
**/.next/
**/out/
**/.vercel/
**/.turbo/

# TypeScript build cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local environment variables and authentication secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs and test output
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/coverage/

# Local certificates and keys
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12

# Editor and operating-system files
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp

# Local ChatGPT/Codex project material—not part of AgentPizza
/sources/
**/AGENTS.md
**/.agents/
**/.codex/
